# Server preflight authenticates once using controlled upstream settings; never forward Supabase JWT or spoof the device IP.
# Purchase upstream is for Socket orders only; local orders never call it.
# Never put the purchase URL in the App client. Strip Supabase-only source/product/quantity fields.
# WithoutReference is valid only when the upstream contract allows omission; it never selects local settlement.
# Configure existing server authentication separately; no real secrets in this file.
### bootstrap-preflight-authenticate
POST https://bibi.byig.top/bibi/constellation/entry
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bibi_edition": "1.0",
  "bell_mark": "",
  "starlight_installation": "fixture-installation-id",
  "constellation_delivery": 2
}

### upstream-confirmPurchase
POST https://bibi.byig.top/bibi/diamonds/settle
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bibi_edition": "1.0",
  "starlight_installation": "fixture-installation-id",
  "diamond_reference": "fixture-apple-transaction",
  "diamond_proof": "SYNTHETIC_RECEIPT_NOT_VALID_FOR_PAYMENT",
  "orbit_order": "fixture-backend-order"
}

### upstream-confirmPurchaseWithoutReference
POST https://bibi.byig.top/bibi/diamonds/settle
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bibi_edition": "1.0",
  "starlight_installation": "fixture-installation-id",
  "diamond_reference": "fixture-apple-transaction",
  "diamond_proof": "SYNTHETIC_RECEIPT_NOT_VALID_FOR_PAYMENT"
}

